{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#118","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#118","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#118\",\"parent_revision\":\"86d0e756a098602db3581cf852dfbf3942e8569719e034460f517e274faa9755\",\"root_revision\":\"86d0e756a098602db3581cf852dfbf3942e8569719e034460f517e274faa9755\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`find_plugin_dir` requires a `plugin.json` to locate the directory it validates. A repository holding only a `marketplace.json` \u2014 which is what a marketplace repository is \u2014 has none, so PL006 never fires.\\n\\nThe practical effect: Anthropic's own marketplace manifest goes unvalidated by the rule written to validate it.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nGive marketplace discovery a path that does not route through `plugin.json`.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- #114 \u2014 PL006's `--fix` behaviour, separate defect in the same rule\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"99dc864a413b970af93e4f5d3b2dcdc8a9505507b972a2e769e627882bf8f82e\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDORXxKvc8AAAABXP-M0Q\"}"}